out", "storyline": "So you think you can act? You and your friends are now actors in a movie! You have the script, microphones are on, and once cameras are rolling you'll need to act out your role and not mess it up! The game will record your voices and character emotes from cinematic angles, and your new movie masterpiece will be screened in the cinema for you to watch together. Will it be a standing ovation? Or a horrendous flop? That\u2019s up to you and your friends! Acting Out is a new type of online co-op multiplayer experience.", "summary": "Don't be shy. Act with everything you've got!\nThe online co-op game where you are actors in a movie, but filming is one-take, do-or-die! Your bloopers won't get cut, so don't screw it up.\nWhether you follow the script or ruin it with improv, you'll watch your masterpiece right away. Will be it great or will it be cringe? That's up to you!", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}, {"id": 31, "name": "Drama"}, {"id": 33, "name": "Sandbox"}, {"id": 40, "name": "Party"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/acting-out", "videos": [{"id": 183316, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "gofBDJFbPSc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gofBDJFbPSc", "title": "Acting Out - Gameplay Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/gofBDJFbPSc/fhddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 186745, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "IYnf81WkHYY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IYnf81WkHYY", "title": "Acting Out | Release Window Trailer | Frosty Games Fest 2026", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/IYnf81WkHYY/fhddefault.jpg"}]}